# Device screenshots of the live game: they show the account's real neighbourhood, the player's
# Mii and friend avatars. Same reason /docs/test/ is excluded in the root .gitignore.
#
# The vision tests skip cleanly (with an explanatory println) when these are absent, so a fresh
# clone still builds and the synthetic tests still run. README.md here says how to re-capture them.
# Delete this file if you decide the set should be shared.
*.png
